    "foodCount": 2121,
    "note": "Public Matvaretabellen foods.json, English and Norwegian, fetched for this lexicon. Names only are pinned in the test fixture."
  },
  "limits": [
    "A phrase is an extra search key for that same catalogue row. It is not a claim that two foods have the same nutrients.",
    "Queries match the whole normalized phrase. Tokens are not OR-ed, so 'chicken' does not pull in every chicken-breast phrase.",
    "Elk is not aliased to moose: in US English elk is a different animal from European elg/moose.",
    "Shrimp and king prawn stay separate. Saithe is coley, not Alaska pollock. Sugar snap is not a snow pea. Swede is not kohlrabi.",
    "Plant drinks are not aliased to milk. Chips, crisps, and fries are not aliased to each other.",
    "Paprika powder is not given the vegetable phrases, and raw coriander leaf is the only row aliased to cilantro.",
    "Official names that are already a single searchable phrase are left alone. Case and spacing of an existing name are not stored again."
  ],
  "prepEn": ["raw", "boiled", "cooked", "fried", "roasted", "grilled", "baked", "steamed", "simmered", "dried", "fresh", "smoked", "canned", "frozen", "uncooked", "pickled", "salted"],
  "prepNb": ["rå", "kokt", "stekt", "ovnsstekt", "grillet", "bakt", "dampet", "tørket", "tørr", "fersk", "røkt", "hermetisk", "fryst", "syltet", "saltet", "naturell"],
  "prepTail": ["in fat", "without fat", "i fett", "uten fett"],
  "rules": [
